stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT: create, import, or copy of a retired version
  DRAFT --> DRAFT: edit (lockVersion), validate, simulate
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL: request-publish, zero validation errors
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> DRAFT: reject
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> PUBLISHED: approve by a different identity
  PUBLISHED --> RETIRED: newer version effective, or retire
  RETIRED --> [*]
  note right of RETIRED
    Immutable. Readable for
    explain and replay forever.
  end note
